title: "finishsim: a cosmetic finish process-capability simulator"
abstract: >-
  Couples Type II sulfuric anodizing kinetics and transfer-matrix thin-film
  optics to a CIE colourimetric pipeline, then propagates process variation
  through to CIEDE2000 colour difference, capability indices and yield.
